<title>SWITZERLAND: Kuehne &amp; Nagel posts higher 1996 profit.</title>
<headline>Kuehne &amp; Nagel posts higher 1996 profit.</headline>
<dateline>SCHINDELLEGI, Switzerland 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>				    (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net			66.5		vs 59.2</p>
<p> Div (bearer, Sfr)	    30		  vs 26</p>
<p> Div (regd, Sfr)		15		  vs 13</p>
<p> Turnover			 5,168	     up 2.1 pct</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit		 114.1	     vs 104</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of freight forwarding group is Kuehne &amp; Nagel International AG.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
